<title>UK: Nordrhein-Westfalen sets 500 mln mark REX bond.</title>
<headline>Nordrhein-Westfalen sets 500 mln mark REX bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Commerzbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NORDRHEIN-WESTFALEN</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   COUPON   **4.6	 MATURITY    26.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE   REX-LINKED    ISS PRICE  99.90     PAY DATE    26.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  20 BP     LISTING    DUES/FFT  PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES	**FIRST COUPON, THEN REX 10-YEAR INDEX TIMES 81 PCT</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 1	   MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC   10 BP</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
